1. MANDATORY INDEPENDENT VERIFICATION AND PROFESSIONAL CONFIRMATION
   This software generates theoretical mathematical estimates only. It is NOT a
   certified dive computer, medical device, or life-support system. Before
   relying on any dive plan, decompression schedule, gas reserve calculation,
